        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915520/extras/d8cc4f484108038c5c9cb9a53e36cea8.avif?t=1789003808\" width=493 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cute and Spooky Creature Collecting Game with a Fall / Halloween Aesthetic</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> An In-Depth Battle System:</strong> with ~250 moves, 15 elemental types, and 4 classes. Providing a wide variety of playstyles and replay value. (There is also a hard mode, for gamers who want an extra challenge)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Explore Unique and Colorful Areas:</strong> Explore moonlit forests, a witch academy, a fairytale town where people live in giant pumpkins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Character:</strong> Set your character's appearance, as well as their class and elemental type, giving every character a unique move-set and role in battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A Bloat-Free RPG Experience:</strong> Pipkin is designed to minimize filler content that is commonplace in RPGs. Wild encounters and grinding, for example, are largely optional, and unnecessary to beat the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Pace:</strong> Players can speed battle animations up to 4x speed, allowing players to breeze through battles as quickly, or as comfortably as they'd like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Average Playthrough Length:</strong> 6-10 hours</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915520/extras/d8cc4f484108038c5c9cb9a53e36cea8.avif?t=1789003808\" width=493 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cute and Spooky Creature Collecting Game with a Fall / Halloween Aesthetic</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> An In-Depth Battle System:</strong> with ~250 moves, 15 elemental types, and 4 classes. Providing a wide variety of playstyles and replay value. (There is also a hard mode, for gamers who want an extra challenge)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Explore Unique and Colorful Areas:</strong> Explore moonlit forests, a witch academy, a fairytale town where people live in giant pumpkins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Character:</strong> Set your character's appearance, as well as their class and elemental type, giving every character a unique move-set and role in battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A Bloat-Free RPG Experience:</strong> Pipkin is designed to minimize filler content that is commonplace in RPGs. Wild encounters and grinding, for example, are largely optional, and unnecessary to beat the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Pace:</strong> Players can speed battle animations up to 4x speed, allowing players to breeze through battles as quickly, or as comfortably as they'd like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Average Playthrough Length:</strong> 6-10 hours</p></li></ul>",
